OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Irish police say they have made the
OL,6, largest and most significant arms find
OL,7, for more than a year.
OL,9,FTwo large oil drums containing guns,
OL,10,Fexplosives and ammunition were found
OL,11,Fburied on the beach between Malin and
OL,12,FMalin Head in County Donegal.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FOne drum contained 90 Kalashnikov
OL,15,Frifles, machine-guns, a large quantity
OL,16,Fof commercial explosives and 6,000
OL,17,Frounds of ammunition. The second tank
OL,18,Fis now being examined.
OL,20,FPolice are questioning a man under the
OL,21,FRepublic's anti-terrorist laws.
OL,23,T]CFrom 28-01-88 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49605
SC,0005
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1769653188
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G5/24
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Talks between Ford management and
OL,6, unions broke down after the unions
OL,7, rejected an improved pay offer.
OL,9,FUnions' leader Mick Murphy said an
OL,10,Fall-out strike by 32,500 Ford manual
OL,11,Fworkers would start on Monday unless
OL,12,Fthe company requested more talks.
OL,14,FThe company said it had made "a number
OL,15,Fof proposals" at a six-hour meeting but
OL,16,Fdid not give details.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FIts earlier offer of a three-year
OL,19,Fpackage was rejected by 88 per cent of
OL,20,Fthe workforce.
OL,23,T]CFrom 28-01-88 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
