CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1769653188
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G6/24
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, No charges will be imposed on patients
OL,6, in NHS hospitals during this
OL,7, parliament, Mrs Thatcher has said.
OL,9,FThe Prime Minister made the promise to
OL,10,FLabour leader Neil Kinnock during
OL,11,FCommons question time.
OL,13,FMrs Thatcher also attacked health
OL,14,Fservice industrial action, saying it
OL,15,Fharmed patients and put a heavier
OL,16,Fburden on those who carried on working.
OL,18,S/FLeaders of the Royal College of
OL,19,FMidwives have protested to Mrs Thatcher
OL,20,Fat her refusal to meet them over the
OL,21,Fhealth service crisis.
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 28-01-88 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49607
SC,0007
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1769653188
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G7/24
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The TUC is planning a major rally in
OL,6, support of nurses' complaints about pay
OL,7, and the funding of the NHS.
OL,9,FThe health services committee of the
OL,10,FTUC - made up of officials of about a
OL,11,Fdozen unions - took the decision at a
OL,12,Fmeeting in London.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FThe rally will be held on March 5,
OL,15,Fshortly before the Budget on March 15.
OL,17,S/FNurses at about 15 London hospitals
OL,18,Fhave voted to strike and voting is
OL,19,Ftaking place at about 20 more. There
OL,20,Fare also ballots in Birmingham, Leeds,
OL,21,FSheffield and Cornwall.
OL,23,T]CFrom 28-01-88 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
