OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,4,F
OL,5, Servicemen who took part in nuclear
OL,6, weapons tests in the 1950s and 1960s
OL,7, were not generally at greater risk of
OL,8, getting cancer, a report has said.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FBut it says there may have been a
OL,11,Fgreater risk of some blood cancers like
OL,12,Fleukaemia.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FA spokesman for the British Nuclear
OL,15,FTests Veterans Association said the
OL,16,Freport was not exhaustive enough and
OL,17,Fcalled for a full judicial inquiry.
OL,19,FThe report was commissioned by the
OL,20,FMinistry of Defence from the National
OL,21,FRadiological Protection Board and the
OL,22,FImperial Cancer Research Fund.
OL,23,                      D]CFrom 28-01-88
