OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, All governments and people the world
OL,6, over must take urgent action to prevent
OL,7, the spread of AIDS, ministers at the
OL,8, world AIDS summit in London have said.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FA 15-point declaration said the
OL,11,Fsyndrome was "a global problem that
OL,12,Fposes a serious threat to humanity."
OL,13,F
OL,14,FIn the absence of a vaccine or cure,
OL,15,Fsaid the ministers, information and
OL,16,Feducation about AIDS was most important
OL,17,F
OL,18,FThey said its spread could be prevented
OL,19,Fthrough informed and responsible
OL,20,Fbehaviour.
OL,21,F
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 28-01-88 / teletextarchive.com
